Inicializar node.js
npm init -y

Instalar TypeScript
npm install -D typescript

Instalar dotenv
npm install dotenv

Crar tsconfig.json
npx tsc --init

Compilar tsc
npx tsc --noEmit

Instalar los tipos de node
npm install -D @types/node

Instalar Fastify
npm install fastify

Instalar Drizzle y postgreSQL Drivers
npm install drizzle-orm postgres

Instalar drizzle-kit
npm install -D drizzle-kit

